OL,3,GNEWSABella's year-long search for her
OL,4,Aforever home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior dog who has spent the past
OL,7,Fyear at a retirement home for pets is
OL,8,Fstill looking for a family to call her
OL,9,Fown.
OL,11,FBella, a 10-year-old Doberman, has
OL,12,Flived at Oakfield Oldies, the Dogs
OL,13,FTrust's Shropshire home for older dogs,
OL,14,Fsince September 2025.
OL,16,FStaff at Dogs Trust Shrewsbury say the
OL,17,F"gentle and affectionate" dog would
OL,18,Fmake a "wonderful companion" and hope
OL,19,Fshe can find a permanent home.
